<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets two-week rev repo, 16 pct limit.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets two-week rev repo, 16 pct limit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Wednesday it would drain liquidity from the local money market through a two-week reverse repo tender, with maximum yield set at 16 percent.</p>
<p>The limit rate is down from 16.2 percent in a similar operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would accept two bids from each party totalling at least 100 million crowns before the deadline at 09:45 a.m. (0745 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
